          "settings": {
            "is_open": true,
            "title": "Should I buy an engagement ring from Crown Moissanite?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. Crown Moissanite offers premium-quality, ethically sourced moissanite rings that combine timeless beauty, durability, and affordability.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "topic_phEhBi": {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "is_open": false,
            "title": "What are the most important things to consider when buying moissanite jewelry?",
            "content": "<p>Focus on the cut, color, and setting quality. Choose reputable brands that provide authenticity certificates and warranties for long-term assurance.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "topic_63Pj7k": {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "is_open": false,
            "title": "What does Crown Moissanite’s Lifetime Warranty cover?",
            "content": "<p>Our Lifetime Warranty covers manufacturing defects, loose stones, and craftsmanship issues. Please note that normal wear and tear or accidental damage is not included.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "topic_NNDaBt": {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "is_open": false,
            "title": "What makes Crown Moissanite different from other jewelry brands?",
            "content": "<p>Crown Moissanite stands out for its handcrafted, ethically sourced fine jewelry made with exceptional craftsmanship and attention to detail. Each piece is custom-made, offering luxury quality, fair pricing, and a lifetime warranty for lasting trust.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "topic_69c36d": {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "is_open": false,
            "title": "Can I book a virtual consultation before ordering?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. You can schedule a video call with our jewelry experts to discuss your preferences and view pieces live.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "topic_zaf6Pi": {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "is_open": false,
            "title": "Does Crown Moissanite have a physical store?",
            "content": "<p>No. Crown Moissanite is an online-only brand. We operate exclusively through our website to provide handcrafted, made-to-order jewelry to customers worldwide.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
