    "accordions": {
      "type": "accordions",
      "blocks": {
        "c2e5d07c-3d54-4bad-b3ae-694d1ef7dbed": {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "is_open": false,
            "title": "⛭ Do you offer custom design?",
            "content": "<p>✧ Yes, we do. You have to share your dream jewelry images with us and we will create it for you.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "06f97daa-496a-417b-aa49-d8a47260cf78": {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "is_open": false,
            "title": "⛭ How custom order work?",
            "content": "<p>✧ We will be pleased to receive the customized and personalized order. We have a simple procedure for customized orders, the steps are as below...</p><ol><li>Start a conversation with one of our jewelry designers about your customized design. They will help you in the designing process of your jewelry also if you have a specific design in your mind send us a picture.</li><li>We will create CAD (Computer Design) of your jewelry and send it to you for confirmation. If you need any changes you can let us know we will do changes according to your requirements.</li><li>Once the CAD is approved from your side. We will Cut & Polish your Moissanite Diamond and start the jewelry manufacturing process.</li><li>When your jewelry is ready to ship, we will share the Images & Videos of your jewelry and then ship it with an international courier company.</li></ol><p>→ Hurry! Now you will have it in your hand in a short time.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "e957eb44-fbe4-4f40-a034-48a4d0a4099a": {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "is_open": false,
            "title": "⛭ Can I customize a Crown Moissanite design?",
            "content": "<p>✧ Yes, most of our designs can be customized to suit your taste and lifestyle, as an example Moissanite can be replaced with Diamond, Sapphires or Emeralds, prong styles can be changes from traditional to claw. Simple design changes will add a extra minimal fee, if the ring design changes in a more significant way like two rings put together, larger or smaller stones are required, a design element is added or removed or if a design image is required, there will be additional charges, or the design may be considered custom at the designer's discretion. Contact Us to discuss the possibilities or to request a quote.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "50884bbc-77d4-4b96-a625-6fc5e6418f48": {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "is_open": false,
            "title": "⛭ Why is buying diamonds from us the best choice?",
            "content": "<p>We obtain natural diamonds from the best sources available. Using state of the art cutting instruments utilized by experts, we meticulously cut and polish our diamonds to meet the demand of discerning customers just like you. For an extra layer of confidence, your loose diamond or diamond jewelry purchased from Crown Moissanite is accompanied by a diamond certificate.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "34b3eb6c-7059-43df-bdf1-7aa6c83ff27b": {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "is_open": false,
            "title": "⛭ Can I order a Crown Moissanite design with any center stone size & shape?",
            "content": "<p>✧ Yes, all of our designs are meant to be customized with your choice of center stone and metal! Most work well with center stone sizes from 0.30 carats to 3.0 carats, and in many shapes like oval, pear, brilliant, etc. Contact Us for center stone size & shape changes.<br/></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "topic_NkpxVV": {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "is_open": false,
            "title": "⛭ Can I upgrade my Diamond in future?",
            "content": "<p>✧ Crown Moissanite is proud to offer lifetime diamond upgrades<strong>.</strong></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "topic_wFMVwf": {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "is_open": false,
            "title": "⛭ Do you offer engraving?",
            "content": "<p>✧ Yes, we offer Free engraving service on our all precious fine jewelry.<br/>After engrave we request to double-check on engraving and ask for the images of engraving before we ship it out to you</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "topic_fk3wRc": {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "is_open": false,
            "title": "⛭ Can I Buy a Setting Without Buying a Diamond?",
            "content": "<p>✧ Yes We do sell only setting.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "topic_BpqY8n": {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "is_open": false,
            "title": "⛭ Do you accept orders over the phone?",
            "content": "<p>✧ Yes. If you prefer to place your order over the phone, we are happy to assist you for all of your questions. You can reach us at +1(708)300-0187 anytime.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "topic_eEDjcX": {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "is_open": false,
            "title": "⛭ Is it possible for me to pay using two different Credit Cards?",
            "content": "<p>✧ No, You can't pay using multiple credit cards. But Please contact us if you would like to pay with Multiple credit cards. We will split the bill in multiple invoices and then you can pay using multiple credit cards.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "topic_Jq3qDQ": {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "is_open": false,
            "title": "⛭ Do You Offer Payment Plans?",
            "content": "<p>✧ Yes, we offer payment plans. You can make your payment in 3 different part of your total amount.<strong><br/></strong></p><h2></h2><p><strong>First:</strong> 35% Payment so we will start CAD design process and confirm with you before start manufacturing process. If you need any changes we will do as per your request.</p><h2></h2><p><strong>Second:</strong> Another, 35% Payment. Now, we will start cutting & polishing process of your diamond and send the video of your forever one diamond.</p><h2></h2><p><strong>Third:</strong> Rest of 30% Payment you have to play before we ship your jewelry. Once, your jewelry is ready to ship we will share the images & video to confirm with you and ship with express courier service.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "topic_cbYMNb": {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "is_open": false,
            "title": "⛭ Rush Order service available?",
            "content": "<p>✧ Yes, we offer rush order service so that you will get your jewelry before the best moment of your life. We do not charge any extra money for rush orders, but please contact us our executives to get exact manufacturing timing at<a href=\"mailto:support@crownmoissanite.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"mailto:support@crownmoissanite.com\"> support@crownmoissanite.com</a>.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
