    "15d37dcd-dfe5-404c-80f1-8f76c2017e23": {
      "type": "accordions",
      "blocks": {
        "template--17062096503099__15d37dcd-dfe5-404c-80f1-8f76c2017e23-16696259764c4b7b62-0": {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "is_open": false,
            "title": "⛭ What is Moissanite?",
            "content": "<p>✧ Moissanite is a new category of gemstone with fire, brilliance and luster more than any other gemstones in the world including diamonds! It is NOT a cubic zirconia which is just a piece of glass but It is a gemstone which looks and lasts like a Diamond Forever <a href=\"https://crownmoissanite.com/pages/what-is-moissanite-diamond-and-its-history?_pos=1&_psq=what+is&_ss=e&_v=1.0\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://crownmoissanite.com/pages/what-is-moissanite-diamond-and-its-history?_pos=1&_psq=what+is&_ss=e&_v=1.0\"><strong>LEARN MORE</strong></a></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "topic_FRRVVh": {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "is_open": false,
            "title": "⛭ Does moissanite change color over time?",
            "content": "<p>No. High-quality moissanite will never lose its color or become cloudy. It maintains its brilliance and clarity for a lifetime.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "topic_L7Hy9U": {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "is_open": false,
            "title": "⛭ Is moissanite suitable for daily wear jewelry?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. Moissanite is highly durable, second only to diamonds on the hardness scale, making it ideal for everyday jewelry like engagement rings and wedding bands.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "template--17062096503099__15d37dcd-dfe5-404c-80f1-8f76c2017e23-16696259764c4b7b62-1": {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "is_open": false,
            "title": "⛭ Are Moissanite available in all shape & size?",
            "content": "<p>✧ Yes, Moissanite are available in all shapes Like Round, Princess, Pear, Oval, Radiant, Trillion, Marquise, Emerald and Cushion. They are also available in all sizer from 0.05ct to 15.0ct.</p><h2></h2>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "template--17062096503099__15d37dcd-dfe5-404c-80f1-8f76c2017e23-16696259764c4b7b62-2": {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "is_open": false,
            "title": "⛭ Your Moissanite is Charles & Colvard Moissanite?",
            "content": "<p>✧ No, we have our own manufacturing factory in Surat (Diamond City) INDIA. All our Moissanite Diamonds are cut & polished by professional artisan of Crown Moissanite Family. We have a team of gemologists who will inspect the diamonds before we stud them in jewelry.</p><h2></h2>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "topic_dBcn9r": {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "is_open": false,
            "title": "⛭ Your Moissanite Diamonds are Certified?",
            "content": "<p>✧ Yes, all our Moissanite Diamonds are certified and tested by International Laboratory. We give a physical authenticity certificate card of your diamond jewelry on request. You must pay a $50USD certification charge. You can also check the authenticity of diamonds from any International Laboratory in your country.</p><h2></h2>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "topic_rYYWdN": {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "is_open": false,
            "title": "⛭ Your Jewelry set in Solid Gold?",
            "content": "<p>✧ Yes, all our Jewelry is make in Solid 10KT, 14KT or 18KT Gold. The color of the gold can be chosen from White, Yellow or Rose.</p><h2></h2>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "topic_K6cwwb": {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "is_open": false,
            "title": "⛭ Does your Jewelry comes with Metal Authenticity Stamp?",
            "content": "<p>✧ Yes, all jewelry comes with metal authenticity stamps. Once your jewelry is ready to ship at our manufacturing unit after that we will send it to the International hallmarking laboratory they will check the metal authenticity & stamp on it.</p><h2></h2>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "topic_F4x3FG": {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "is_open": false,
            "title": "⛭ What Metal Do you use?",
            "content": "<p>We use gold metal, specifically gold with an authenticity stamp. The authenticity stamp ensures the quality and genuineness of the gold used in our products.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "topic_zT9U8T": {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "is_open": false,
            "title": "⛭ Are lab grown diamonds real?",
            "content": "<p>Yes! Lab grown diamonds are just as real as mined diamonds.</p><p>With the exact same optical, chemical, thermal and physical properties, the only difference between lab grown diamonds and mined diamonds is their origin. Lab grown diamonds are grown in controlled laboratory environments that produce the same pressure and heat conditions that form mined diamonds in the earth's crust.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
