    "accordions_bxzxXw": {
      "type": "accordions",
      "blocks": {
        "topic_CFdLgM": {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "is_open": false,
            "title": "⛭ What is Crown Moissanite Return & Refund Policy?",
            "content": "<p>✧ We will accept return and exchange on most pieces. Items must be returned in unworn condition within 30 days of receipt. All returns will incur a 20% restocking fee. Read our Return & Refund Policy <a href=\"https://crownmoissanite.myshopify.com/pages/refund-policy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://crownmoissanite.myshopify.com/pages/refund-policy\">here</a>.</p><h2></h2>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "topic_JbKr3L": {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "is_open": false,
            "title": "⛭ The ring I ordered doesn’t fit. Can you resize it?",
            "content": "<p>✧ <strong>Yes, absolutely.</strong> As long as it’s a Crown Moissanite piece (that is not an eternity band version of one of our designs), we will resize it at minimal cost.</p><p>✨ <strong>Complimentary Resize Offer:</strong> We are pleased to offer <strong>one free ring resize within 30 days of purchase</strong>.</p><p>✧ <strong>Full Eternity Rings:</strong> Rings featuring a shank adorned with full eternity stones cannot be resized due to their intricate design. Instead, customers are encouraged to exchange the ring for the correct size. Our customer service team is happy to assist with this process.</p><p>✧ <strong>Unique Shank Designs:</strong> If your ring has a unique or intricate shank design, we will first inspect the ring and then inform you whether resizing is possible or not.</p><p>You can find more information about returns, resizing, and repairs here.<br/> Email us at <a href=\"mailto:support@crownmoissanite.com\" title=\"mailto:support@crownmoissanite.com\"><strong>support@crownmoissanite.com</strong></a> if you have any additional questions.</p><p><em><strong>Please note: </strong></em><em>Shipping charges for the resize service will be the customer’s responsibility.</em></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "topic_AdWy96": {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "is_open": false,
            "title": "⛭ What if i want to cancel my order before shipping?",
            "content": "<p>If we receive your cancellation request within 24hours- we will refund you the full amount-else 20% restocking fee will be deducted</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "topic_fg6q7M": {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "is_open": false,
            "title": "⛭ I accidentally damaged my jewelry! What do I do?",
            "content": "<p>✧ Don’t worry. We’ll take care of you! We’re happy to repair any piece you purchased from our collection, and we stand by our work.</p><p>We’re proud to provide our limited lifetime warranty for all of our pieces. So rest easy—Whenever your piece needs servicing, know that we’ll handle it with genuine care for as long as you own it. For more details, please visit our <a href=\"https://crownmoissanite.myshopify.com/pages/refund-policy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://crownmoissanite.myshopify.com/pages/refund-policy\">Repairs</a> page.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "topic_drPA3B": {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "is_open": false,
            "title": "⛭ How to take care of jewelry?",
            "content": "<p>✧ Jewelry care is a very important part once you use them on a regular basis. Read our blog to get tips to care jewelry at your home... <a href=\"https://crownmoissanite.myshopify.com/pages/jewelry-care\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://crownmoissanite.myshopify.com/pages/jewelry-care\"><strong>REA</strong></a><a href=\"https://www.touchedoree.com/pages/10-tips-to-make-your-jewelry-shine-forever\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>D</strong></a></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
